---
description: Prevent decorative 1px outlines from making UI look generic or AI-generated
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Decorative Hairlines

- Do not use decorative 1px borders or outlines to define cards, modals, badges, pills, panels, or separators.
- Build hierarchy with tonal surfaces, spacing, elevation, or inset highlights.
- Borders must communicate a real state or follow a deliberate structural border token.
- Preserve visible keyboard focus indicators; this rule does not remove functional focus treatment.
